(text "1 return | 2 HARNESS EMPTY (PCB GND) | 3 fused switched12V | 4 NC\n5 CANL | 6 CANH | 7 oil signal | 8 protected5V OUTPUT | 9 oil return\n10/11/12 NC. Seven leads; cavities2/4/10/11/12 empty. No IGN/chassis straps.\nINT22-02: one full-current return atF1.1; no parallel-load current sharing.\nF1 wire exit relaxed25.4–30mm before bend/tie/twist; tin-to-tin mating only.\nASC cavity map, actual plug exit, crimp and continuity remain installation gates.\nUse current HARNESS_INTERFACE_CONTRACT; keyed face/latch orientation must be bound.\nOil return joins the continuous PCB reference; no sensor-A-to-case jumper.\nPin2 stays electricallyGND in CAD; the harness terminal/wire is omitted." (at 20.32 124.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "99ad6e41-87d4-54d4-b108-7b7146683f6b"))
